So `ApplyChromeTheme` must ask the panel:

```cpp
static void ApplyChromeTheme()
{
    int mode = kThemeMode;
    if (g_hPanel)
        mode = GetThemeMode(g_hPanel);
    ApplyTitleBarTheme(g_hFrame, ResolveDarkMode(static_cast<ThemeMode>(mode)));
}
```

That handles menu changes. For a custom palette, `GetThemeMode` returns the last mode (may not match the custom palette) — acceptable for the standalone app, which doesn't set custom palettes.

